WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:07.150
The new morning we've finally found

00:00.270 --> 00:07.150
Yatto mitsuketa atarashii asa wa

00:07.150 --> 00:11.190
is being hampered by the past.

00:07.150 --> 00:11.190
Tsukihi ga jama wo suru

00:11.390 --> 00:16.660
What we chased after wasn't the future,

00:11.390 --> 00:16.660
Mukau saki wa tsugi ja nakute

00:16.660 --> 00:20.490
but the past so full of remorse.

00:16.660 --> 00:20.490
Sugi bakari oikaketa

00:21.870 --> 00:26.960
The ruthless memories won't stop playing;

00:21.870 --> 00:26.960
Nariyamanai yousha nai omoide tachi wa

00:26.960 --> 00:31.050
they won't be forgiving us for a long time.

00:26.960 --> 00:31.050
Yurushite kuresou nimonai

00:32.340 --> 00:36.890
It's about now that a teardrop

00:32.340 --> 00:36.890
Sorosoro kana tesaguri tsukareta hoho wo

00:36.890 --> 00:41.560
beings to roll down my fatigued cheeks.

00:36.890 --> 00:41.560
Kattou ga koboreochiru

00:41.890 --> 00:46.810
Will this rain ever stop?

00:41.890 --> 00:46.810
Ame wa itsuka yamunodeshouka

00:46.810 --> 00:52.030
I've been freezing for a long time.

00:46.810 --> 00:52.030
Zuibun nagai aida tsumetai

00:52.030 --> 00:57.320
Why does the rain continue to fix on me?

00:52.030 --> 00:57.320
Ame wa doushite boku wo erabuno

00:57.320 --> 01:02.080
I wonder if it could embrace me.

00:57.320 --> 01:02.080
Tsutsumarete iikana

01:02.080 --> 01:06.870
Today, the rain falls again;

01:02.080 --> 01:06.870
Ame wa yamu koto wo shirazuni

01:06.870 --> 01:12.090
endlessly it falls knowing no end.

01:06.870 --> 01:12.090
Kyou mo furitsuzukukeredo

01:12.090 --> 01:17.130
We nestle close to each other to share the warmth

01:12.090 --> 01:17.130
Sotto sashidashita kasa no naka de

01:17.680 --> 01:28.850
under this umbrella, you gently held out to me.

01:17.680 --> 01:28.850
Nukumori ni yorisoinagara

01:32.780 --> 01:33.900
Fullmetal!

01:36.740 --> 01:37.990
He disappeared?!

01:38.610 --> 01:39.780
What did you do?!

01:48.250 --> 01:52.840
He was simply escorted to a place
you'll eventually arrive at yourself.

02:00.430 --> 02:02.600
What the hell is this?

02:04.560 --> 02:06.390
This sensation...

02:07.390 --> 02:08.100
That's right!

02:08.850 --> 02:11.980
The same sensation I got when I opened the Gate of Truth!

02:15.380 --> 02:18.380
Sacrifices

02:15.380 --> 02:18.380
Sacrifices

03:01.320 --> 03:02.490
Dammit!

03:02.490 --> 03:04.240
You son of a bitch!

03:25.390 --> 03:26.220
You're...!

03:26.970 --> 03:28.310
Idiot!

03:28.310 --> 03:29.600
Leave this place to us!

03:30.690 --> 03:33.730
It's our duty...

03:34.310 --> 03:36.110
...to protect the young master.

03:39.150 --> 03:42.280
It's impossible to carry this much weight with an automail!

03:42.280 --> 03:44.320
Worry about your grandfather instead!

03:46.030 --> 03:46.870
It's...

03:47.830 --> 03:49.160
...too late.

03:53.370 --> 03:55.580
Briggs soldiers, lend me a hand!

03:57.340 --> 03:58.170
Right!

04:00.050 --> 04:02.760
Bradley, eat this!

04:14.850 --> 04:16.020
Fu!

04:18.570 --> 04:19.530
Fu!!

04:27.830 --> 04:29.450
Someone call a doctor!

04:29.450 --> 04:31.750
Are there any doctors well-versed in alchemy?!

04:31.750 --> 04:32.910
I've...

04:32.910 --> 04:34.500
I've got a philosopher's stone right here!

04:35.420 --> 04:37.130
Use as much of it as you need!

04:38.920 --> 04:40.050
Anyone!

04:40.050 --> 04:41.260
Please!

04:41.260 --> 04:44.180
Isn't Amestris the land of alchemy?!

04:44.680 --> 04:46.300
There's gotta be someone here!

04:46.300 --> 04:46.890
Hey!!

04:50.930 --> 04:52.140
Why...?

04:58.110 --> 04:58.900
Why...

05:03.900 --> 05:04.610
Young master!

05:08.700 --> 05:11.040
You monster...

05:15.870 --> 05:16.920
Why...

05:18.580 --> 05:23.960
I can't save a single vassal despite achieving immortality...?

05:24.970 --> 05:28.090
Fuck!!

05:30.640 --> 05:31.260
Captain!

05:31.850 --> 05:34.020
Captain, get yourself together!

05:34.230 --> 05:35.480
Captain!

05:35.480 --> 05:36.520
Captain!!

05:36.520 --> 05:37.650
Captain!!

05:38.310 --> 05:39.060
Fire!

05:48.280 --> 05:52.540
We were able to give Bradley a fatal wound thanks to you.

05:54.660 --> 05:57.370
Even though you ensured that Fu's death would not be in vain,

05:58.170 --> 06:00.130
I can't even do a thing to help you.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.590
Give me ammo!

06:10.590 --> 06:12.180
That was the last round!

06:15.350 --> 06:16.810
Shit!

06:16.810 --> 06:18.140
I'm out too!

06:20.560 --> 06:22.310
Everyone, fire back with your rifles!

06:22.310 --> 06:23.230
Roger!

06:34.120 --> 06:36.250
Lin Yao...

06:38.120 --> 06:40.960
Or Greed, whichever you are...

06:41.630 --> 06:46.460
If you're truly thankful, would you mind doing me a favor?

06:47.630 --> 06:54.470
We're not supposed to let this gate open until our Queen orders it to be.

06:56.100 --> 06:59.480
Please, protect it...

07:02.730 --> 07:06.530
It should be possible with your strength...

07:07.280 --> 07:12.030
No, only you... can do it...

07:12.200 --> 07:13.410
I'm begging you...

07:38.470 --> 07:39.480
Greed.

07:40.180 --> 07:41.190
Yo?

07:42.350 --> 07:43.770
I want power.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.650
Lend me some.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.860
Sure thing.

07:49.860 --> 07:52.780
We've still got some time until my next plan.

07:56.450 --> 07:59.160
Lan Fan, you protect the people here.

07:59.160 --> 08:00.160
Roger!

08:01.580 --> 08:04.580
Could you... do that for me?

08:04.580 --> 08:07.090
Yeah, I promise.

08:10.630 --> 08:12.550
People from Xing...

08:14.760 --> 08:18.010
...never break alliances!

08:22.850 --> 08:24.270
Fire! Fire!

08:37.450 --> 08:39.790
W-Who the hell is that?!

08:41.000 --> 08:42.450
All right, listen up!

08:43.750 --> 08:45.830
Those who don't wish to get hurt,

08:45.830 --> 08:48.790
and those who have family and lovers, stand back!

08:50.460 --> 08:52.010
And women, too!

08:52.010 --> 08:54.720
I don't particularly enjoy fighting women!

09:11.820 --> 09:12.820
No way...!

10:12.840 --> 10:13.880
Fire!!

10:35.070 --> 10:36.440
Incredible...

10:36.440 --> 10:38.400
Lin Yao.

10:38.400 --> 10:40.950
Or should I say, Homunculus?

10:54.750 --> 10:57.970
How promising they are once you have one on your side...

10:59.680 --> 11:00.510
Captain!

11:00.880 --> 11:01.760
Captain!

11:08.850 --> 11:11.650
Captain, please hang in there!

11:11.650 --> 11:15.320
Did he... join our side?

11:15.320 --> 11:16.110
Yes, sir!

11:17.860 --> 11:20.570
Now I can kick the bucket in peace...

11:20.570 --> 11:22.610
What are you saying, Captain?!

11:22.610 --> 11:25.700
Major General Armstrong will achieve victory soon!

11:25.700 --> 11:27.080
Just a little longer!

11:27.080 --> 11:31.580
We need you to take an even more active role in Central than ever before!

11:37.710 --> 11:41.760
I don't like the sooty sky here in Central...

11:42.430 --> 11:45.220
Farewell, comrades...

11:46.350 --> 11:49.770
I'll go on ahead...

11:53.100 --> 11:58.320
...to an even higher place than the summit of Briggs...

12:01.200 --> 12:03.660
Captain Buccaneer!!!

12:07.780 --> 12:10.620
What was that flash of light from before?

12:10.620 --> 12:12.210
There hasn't been a single announcement.

12:12.710 --> 12:16.460
What's going on with military headquarters?

12:16.460 --> 12:19.670
No follow-up reports from Radio Capital?

12:19.670 --> 12:21.470
Nope.

12:21.470 --> 12:23.010
What about the other stations?

12:24.010 --> 12:27.350
They're just announcing a curfew for the moment.

12:30.680 --> 12:33.270
Mommy!

12:33.770 --> 12:37.060
The radio tells us we can't go outside,

12:37.060 --> 12:40.400
so let's hold off on going to Tabasa's house today, okay, Elicia?

12:40.400 --> 12:41.780
What?!

12:42.780 --> 12:45.200
We can see the solar eclipse from here, too.

12:45.200 --> 12:47.200
It's about to begin,

12:47.200 --> 12:49.790
so let's watch it from here with Mommy.

13:00.590 --> 13:02.090
Izumi!

13:02.880 --> 13:04.220
Where are you?!

13:05.050 --> 13:06.590
Izumi!!

13:07.590 --> 13:10.350
Alex, do you know what just happened?

13:11.890 --> 13:14.850
I heard this from the Elric Brothers in the past.

13:15.850 --> 13:18.020
They said that when they performed human transmutation,

13:18.020 --> 13:21.860
they were dragged into the Gate of Truth by black hands.

13:25.320 --> 13:26.990
What is this "Gate of Truth" you speak of?

13:28.740 --> 13:30.080
I have no idea.

13:30.740 --> 13:32.290
What did you say?!

13:32.290 --> 13:33.410
Were you able to get in touch with them?

13:34.710 --> 13:37.370
Major General, headquarters is safe.

13:37.370 --> 13:38.460
Good.

13:38.460 --> 13:41.960
And, did you obtain any information pertaining to Miss Izumi's situation?

13:44.840 --> 13:45.720
No...

13:46.220 --> 13:47.340
I see...

13:48.760 --> 13:49.510
And what else?

13:51.310 --> 13:54.270
During a battle with King Bradley,

13:54.270 --> 13:59.900
Captain Buccaneer, who was defending the main gate,

14:01.730 --> 14:03.400
lost his life along with a few other men.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.910
It has been reported that the captain,
working together with someone from Xing,

14:09.280 --> 14:13.540
successfully gave Bradley a fatal wound and knocked him down into a canal.

14:14.870 --> 14:16.200
Impossible!

14:17.160 --> 14:19.170
There's no way that can be true!

14:19.170 --> 14:23.460
How could that King Bradley die so easily?!

14:23.460 --> 14:24.920
He's not human-

14:28.260 --> 14:30.140
And what about the main gate?

14:30.760 --> 14:32.350
It's still being defended.

14:33.060 --> 14:36.140
A homunculus by the name of Greed joined their side,

14:36.140 --> 14:38.350
and tore apart the central soldiers at the main gate.

14:39.020 --> 14:40.940
A homunculus?!

14:41.230 --> 14:42.650
Impossible.

14:42.650 --> 14:45.530
A homunculus would never turn its fangs on that man...

14:46.190 --> 14:49.780
Apparently, Captain Buccaneer passed away with a smile.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.280
I see.

14:55.200 --> 14:59.250
If he died with a smile, we can't sit here and weep.

15:00.580 --> 15:01.540
Let's proceed!

15:01.540 --> 15:02.290
Roger!

15:03.290 --> 15:04.960
Let's go, Mr. Sig.

15:05.840 --> 15:08.050
We also need to look for your wife.

15:09.470 --> 15:10.300
Right.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.450
Ouch...

15:32.070 --> 15:32.990
Oww...

15:33.910 --> 15:34.780
Master!

15:38.250 --> 15:39.000
Ed!

15:39.660 --> 15:41.040
Are you okay?!

15:41.040 --> 15:42.870
Yeah, somewhat.

15:43.500 --> 15:45.540
What are you doing here?

15:46.130 --> 15:47.920
That's what I want to know.

15:47.920 --> 15:50.420
So, where are we?

15:51.090 --> 15:52.800
I don't know.

15:52.800 --> 15:54.680
I was just sent here all of a sudden...

15:57.310 --> 15:58.270
Al!

16:00.770 --> 16:01.230
Al!

16:01.270 --> 16:02.140
Hey!

16:01.270 --> 16:02.140
Even Al?

16:02.140 --> 16:02.690
Get yourself together!

16:02.690 --> 16:05.270
Could it be that all the human sacrifices were gathered?

16:03.560 --> 16:04.770
What's wrong, Al?!

16:05.270 --> 16:05.980
Hey!

16:08.570 --> 16:12.070
One, two, three...

16:14.530 --> 16:16.280
...and four.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.290
We're missing one.

16:22.410 --> 16:26.330
I guess the last one is currently being made.

16:26.630 --> 16:30.260
W-What the hell is this monster?

16:30.760 --> 16:32.010
Hohenheim!

16:33.630 --> 16:35.470
Edward...

16:35.470 --> 16:38.430
Even Alphonse was captured...?

16:38.430 --> 16:40.600
Whoa, Miss Izumi as well.

16:40.850 --> 16:44.390
Sorry I'm in such a pitiful state.

16:44.390 --> 16:46.100
What in the world is going on?

16:46.810 --> 16:48.820
Well...

16:48.820 --> 16:51.030
You stay put.

16:51.780 --> 16:57.450
I'll slowly absorb the philosopher's stone inside you later.

16:57.450 --> 17:01.040
Who the hell is that dark guy, Hohenheim?!{black guy lol}

17:01.830 --> 17:03.620
My alter ego.

17:03.620 --> 17:07.790
The guy who the homunculi called 'Father'.

17:10.300 --> 17:13.010
That's the geezer?!

17:13.550 --> 17:15.220
Yeah.

17:15.220 --> 17:17.590
I was able to destroy his skin, but...

17:18.140 --> 17:22.770
Quit your blabbering, Hohenheim.

17:23.350 --> 17:28.980
I welcome you, human sacrifices.

17:30.230 --> 17:33.990
Thanks for coming to my castle.

17:36.450 --> 17:38.070
Al, wake up.

17:38.070 --> 17:40.080
This one's going to be tough.

17:40.490 --> 17:41.540
Al?

17:42.410 --> 17:43.910
Hey, Al!

17:44.750 --> 17:45.870
Alphonse!

17:48.920 --> 17:52.170
The ones up there are so unreliable.

17:52.800 --> 17:57.800
They couldn't even prepare five human sacrifices for this day?

18:02.390 --> 18:07.600
Well, I gathered all the ones who've been seeking morsels like immortality,

18:07.850 --> 18:10.980
so it's no surprise that they couldn't do their jobs.

18:17.820 --> 18:18.780
Damn you!

18:33.880 --> 18:37.170
Excellent. Stay just like that.

18:37.970 --> 18:42.720
Now, Mustang, we don't have much time.

18:42.720 --> 18:45.850
I'd appreciate it if you could willingly cooperate with me.

18:46.350 --> 18:51.270
Do you mind performing human transmutation and opening the gate?

18:51.270 --> 18:52.440
What?

18:52.440 --> 18:53.980
I don't care who you transmutate.

18:55.280 --> 19:00.070
Your late parents, your lover, your friend.

19:00.660 --> 19:02.910
The one you were close to...

19:02.910 --> 19:05.040
What was his name again?

19:05.040 --> 19:05.990
Hughes.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.750
I don't mind if you transmutate him.

19:08.750 --> 19:11.750
We'll take care of all the arrangements.

19:12.960 --> 19:15.750
The ones you call... "human sacrifices"?

19:15.960 --> 19:17.460
Precisely.

19:17.460 --> 19:21.050
Those who open the gate can become human sacrifices.

19:21.680 --> 19:24.760
So that's why the Elric Brothers were chosen.

19:24.760 --> 19:26.220
Yup.

19:26.680 --> 19:30.520
I heard from them that human transmutation doesn't work.

19:30.520 --> 19:33.610
What idiot would try it when they know it's not going to work?!

19:34.150 --> 19:36.360
Good point there.

19:36.360 --> 19:39.740
So as long as you open the gate and come back, it's fine.

19:40.320 --> 19:41.820
I refuse!

19:41.820 --> 19:43.700
I won't perform human transmutation!

19:43.700 --> 19:44.950
I won't open the gate either!

19:49.830 --> 19:54.210
Didn't I tell you that we don't have much time?

20:01.760 --> 20:02.760
Lieutenant!

20:03.300 --> 20:04.430
Lieutenant?!

20:04.430 --> 20:05.350
Lieutenant!

20:06.010 --> 20:10.930
Now, open the gate, Mustang.

20:10.930 --> 20:12.600
You scum!!

20:14.400 --> 20:16.440
Lieutenant! Can you hear me?!

20:16.440 --> 20:17.730
Say something!

20:18.110 --> 20:22.570
Now, perform human transmutation and become the fifth sacrifice.

20:25.370 --> 20:30.040
Come on, if you don't pick up the pace, this woman will die.

20:31.000 --> 20:32.710
Oh, I get it.

20:32.710 --> 20:35.960
You're going to transmute her back after she dies?

20:35.960 --> 20:37.840
That's fine too.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.300
I won't die...

20:43.550 --> 20:48.680
I've been ordered not to die...

20:49.310 --> 20:52.730
If one could obtain an immortal body with an order like that,

20:52.730 --> 20:55.230
everyone would live without worry.

20:55.980 --> 20:59.610
What will you do, Mustang?

20:59.610 --> 21:03.030
A woman who's precious to you is dying.

21:04.200 --> 21:06.780
If you leave her be, she'll die from blood loss.

21:07.530 --> 21:11.830
But I'm a doctor well-versed in alchemy,

21:11.830 --> 21:15.210
and tadaa, I even have a philosopher's stone.

21:15.750 --> 21:24.130
In other words, I can save this woman's life.

21:26.090 --> 21:33.430
Well, if she dies before you make a decision, there'll be nothing I can do.

21:34.980 --> 21:36.020
Oh?

21:40.480 --> 21:42.650
She's gotten quiet.

21:42.650 --> 21:44.690
I wonder if she died.

21:46.450 --> 21:47.450
Colonel...

21:48.910 --> 21:54.620
There's no need... for you to perform human transmutation.

21:55.540 --> 21:58.420
You'll do it, won't you, Mustang?

22:09.470 --> 22:10.970
Now!

22:22.650 --> 22:24.070
I will.

22:38.250 --> 22:41.800
Ever since that day passed,

22:38.250 --> 22:41.800
Ano hi kara zutto

22:41.800 --> 22:46.050
I promised myself that I'd never cry.

22:41.800 --> 22:46.050
Nakanaito kimetekitakedo

22:46.590 --> 22:51.600
But even while I hoarded up the pain,

22:46.590 --> 22:51.600
Itami wo kasanetemo

22:51.600 --> 22:56.710
there was something I couldn't forgive myself for.

22:51.600 --> 22:56.710
Nanika wo yurusezu ni ita

22:58.190 --> 23:00.150
I'll never be able

22:58.190 --> 23:00.150
Mou modorenai

23:00.150 --> 23:02.650
to return to those days.

23:00.150 --> 23:02.650
Ikutsumo no hibi

23:02.650 --> 23:07.740
I'm still powerless.

23:02.650 --> 23:07.740
Boku wa mada nanimo dekizuni

23:07.740 --> 23:12.990
I watch as the shards of memories disappear, one by one;

23:07.740 --> 23:12.990
Kimi no ita kioku no kakera

23:12.990 --> 23:18.860
memories of when you were still with me.

23:12.990 --> 23:18.860
Mata hitotsu kieteyuku

23:19.540 --> 23:21.880
I long to become

23:19.540 --> 23:21.880
Kyou yori motto

23:21.880 --> 23:24.630
stronger than I am now,

23:21.880 --> 23:24.630
Tsuyoku naritai

23:24.630 --> 23:29.770
so that my voice will eventually reach you.

23:24.630 --> 23:29.770
Kono koe ga itsuka todokuyouni

23:29.770 --> 23:32.140
If the wind happens to stop

23:29.770 --> 23:32.140
Arukitsuzukete

23:32.140 --> 23:34.850
in the midst of my long journey,

23:32.140 --> 23:34.850
Kaze ga yandara

23:34.850 --> 23:39.560
I'll look up at the sky in search of you.

23:34.850 --> 23:39.560
Kimi wo sagashite sora miageruyo

23:40.310 --> 23:46.900
Beyond the daybreak, a ray of light breaks free.

23:40.310 --> 23:46.900
Yoake no saki ni hikari ga sasuyo

23:48.070 --> 23:52.450
A rainbow spans across the sky.

23:48.070 --> 23:52.450
Niji ga kakaruyo

23:57.990 --> 24:01.960
Though there may be favorable turn,

24:01.960 --> 24:05.540
know that this repose last but a moment.

24:06.290 --> 24:11.130
The place upon which thou standest is the entrance to the netherworld.

24:12.510 --> 24:16.640
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

24:16.640 --> 24:21.140
Episode 59, Lost Light.

24:16.660 --> 24:21.160
Lost Light

24:22.640 --> 24:26.110
The end is near.
